                              "blockName":  "Source",
                              "blockType":  "Source",
                              "rawSource":  "\u0026TurnoId = 0\n\u0026Now = Now()\n\u0026Hora = \u0026Now.Hour()\n\nfor each DB.Turno\n\tOrder TurnoHoraInicio\n\twhere TurnoId \u003e 0\n\t\u0026TurnoId = DB.TurnoId\n\t\u0026HoraInicio = TurnoHoraInicio.Hour()\n\t\u0026HoraFin = TurnoHoraFin.Hour()\n\t\u0026Diff = \u0026HoraFin - \u0026HoraInicio\n\t\n\tDo Case\n\t\tCase \u0026Diff \u003e 0 and \u0026Hora \u003e= \u0026HoraInicio and \u0026Hora \u003c \u0026HoraFin\n\t\t     Exit\n\t\t\n\t\tCase \u0026Diff \u003c 0 and (\u0026Hora \u003e= \u0026HoraInicio or \u0026Hora \u003c \u0026HoraFin)\n\t\t     Exit\n\tEndCase\nendfor\n\n",
                              "cleanSource":  "\u0026TurnoId = 0\n\u0026Now = Now()\n\u0026Hora = \u0026Now.Hour()\n\nfor each DB.Turno\n\tOrder TurnoHoraInicio\n\twhere TurnoId \u003e 0\n\t\u0026TurnoId = DB.TurnoId\n\t\u0026HoraInicio = TurnoHoraInicio.Hour()\n\t\u0026HoraFin = TurnoHoraFin.Hour()\n\t\u0026Diff = \u0026HoraFin - \u0026HoraInicio\n\t\n\tDo Case\n\t\tCase \u0026Diff \u003e 0 and \u0026Hora \u003e= \u0026HoraInicio and \u0026Hora \u003c \u0026HoraFin\n\t\t     Exit\n\t\t\n\t\tCase \u0026Diff \u003c 0 and (\u0026Hora \u003e= \u0026HoraInicio or \u0026Hora \u003c \u0026HoraFin)\n\t\t     Exit\n\tEndCase\nendfor"
                          },
                          {
                              "blockName":  "Rules",
                              "blockType":  "Rules",
                              "rawSource":  "parm(out:\u0026TurnoId);\n",
                              "cleanSource":  "parm(out:\u0026TurnoId);"
                          }
                      ],
